Read-only on staging: the real Authentication-Results has `mx_ok` true and DKIM, DMARC and SPF pass all false, and `header.from=pmgwa.com.au` matches. Person and mark prosrc match the r514 hashes. Nothing was written.

Local Postgres only: the new function accepts that payload for IS60353006 and stores the Authentication-Results unchanged. The same payload without `auth_as` returns `unverified_or_ambiguous_confirmation`. External SPF/DKIM/DMARC still pass. A Gmail mailbox with `auth_as=Internal` and this Authentication-Results still fails. The Gmail classic path still passes. `quote_literal` restores person prosrc to `eb02f76ec94cd0b6c824a18660432afa`. The 32 check cases match. `service_role` has no EXECUTE.

